Last night there was a power cut. Malis was reading by candlelight. Her brother was eating a midnight snack in the kitchen. Suddenly, they heard a strange noise and footsteps! Dad was looking around with his torchlight. Then the alarm rang. Who was it? It was Grandpa. He was sleepwalking!

